title: Computer
---
<<declare $computer_state = 0>>

<<if $computer_state == 0>>
    Your computer. 
    The news channel continues to play. You wonder why the reporters still work after the recent news. 
    <<set $computer_state = 1>>
<<elseif $computer_state == 1>>
    You swiftly changed to another video.
    The familiar sounds of an afternoon cooking show fill your room. 
    You feel content.
    <<set $computer_state = 2>>
<<else>>
    <<TurnOffComputer ApartmentComputer>>
    You turn the computer off.
<<endif>>
===
